{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"monokai-classic","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"Monokai Classic","description":"High contrast colors on a warm dark background.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Monokai Classic","path":"themes/monokai-classic.json","uiTheme":"dark"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/monokai-classic.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Monokai Classic\",\n  \"type\": \"dark\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#272822\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#f8f8f2\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#1e1f1c\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#1e1f1c\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#1e1f1c\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#1e1f1c\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#3e3d32\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#49483e\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#3e3d32\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#1e1f1c\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#1b1c19\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#a6e22e\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#a6e22e\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#a6e22e\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#49483e\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#3e3d3280\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#a6e22e\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#1b1c19\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#f92672\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#a6e22e\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#e6db74\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#f92672\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#75715e\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#e6db74\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ae81ff\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f92672\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#66d9ef\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#a6e22e\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#ae81ff\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f8f8f2\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#f92672\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#a6e22e\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#fd971f\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Monokai Classic\n\nHigh contrast colors on a warm dark background.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Monokai Classic** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a dark theme.\n\nInspired by the Monokai palette.\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#272822` |\n| Text | `#f8f8f2` |\n| Accent | `#a6e22e` |\n| Keywords | `#f92672` |\n| Strings | `#e6db74` |\n| Functions | `#a6e22e` |\n| Types | `#66d9ef` |\n| Comments | `#75715e` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}